fenvix-app (branch claude/github-app), infra/: Node engine in the runs-on: fenvix machine image.
Written by the runner-node session of fenvix-engine-cli (branch claude/runner-node); NOT pushed to fenvix-app.

What it does: adds one EC2 Image Builder component, infra/imagebuilder/components/fenvix-node.yml, which runs
runner/bootstrap.sh engines (FENVIX_LANGS=node) from fenvix-engine-cli at a pinned commit: Node 26.13.1 (Active LTS,
SHA-256 checked), corepack shims (pnpm/yarn), detjs built from claude/node-l0 8e9209b, fenvix-run with the Node
path; then adds FENVIX_DETJS and the Node directories to the Actions runner's .env; validates (node version, pnpm,
yarn, detjs --det-help, .env line) and tests (a Vitest fixture with an order-dependent test must be reported flaky
with a replay that reproduces it). Every phase was run (parameters substituted, scratch paths) in the session's
container: all passed.

